<title>THAILAND: Thai Engine plans 30 mln baht share issue.</title>
<headline>Thai Engine plans 30 mln baht share issue.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Engine Manufacturing Plc said on Thursday it planned to raise registered capital to 240 million baht from 210 million baht through a new share issue.</p>
<p>Thai Engine, a farm diesel engine manufacturer, said in a statement to the Stock Exchange of Thailand that its directors decided on Wednesday to float up to three million new 10-baht-par shares.</p>
</text>
